WEBVTT

00:00:12.618 --> 00:00:13.735
Come on.

00:00:15.690 --> 00:00:18.134
There he is!
Go! Go, go, go!

00:00:24.558 --> 00:00:26.164
[Maddie yelling]

00:00:27.003 --> 00:00:28.003
No!

00:00:28.003 --> 00:00:29.183
We got you, Sonic.

00:00:30.288 --> 00:00:31.807
Hold on!

00:00:40.165 --> 00:00:42.928
[all panting]

00:00:44.793 --> 00:00:46.373
You guys okay?
[Tom grunts] Yeah.

00:00:48.169 --> 00:00:49.962
Okay.

00:00:55.043 --> 00:00:57.423
I got the Emerald.
We could still defeat him.

00:00:57.623 --> 00:01:00.223
Come on, come on.
How does this thing work?
What do I do?

00:01:00.378 --> 00:01:01.886
[cracking]

00:01:02.043 --> 00:01:03.043
What?

00:01:03.158 --> 00:01:06.356
No. No, no, no!

00:01:10.442 --> 00:01:14.163
Look at the happy little family.

00:01:20.143 --> 00:01:22.802
You have to
get away from me.
I'm the one he wants.

00:01:22.922 --> 00:01:23.922
Hey.

00:01:24.302 --> 00:01:25.422
We're not going anywhere.

00:01:26.462 --> 00:01:27.462
We're family.

00:01:31.043 --> 00:01:32.482
And families
stick together...

00:01:35.793 --> 00:01:36.793
no matter what.

00:01:39.942 --> 00:01:41.123
I love you guys.

00:01:42.362 --> 00:01:43.362
We love you too,
Sonic.

00:01:43.472 --> 00:01:46.031
[chaos emeralds chiming]

00:01:52.500 --> 00:01:54.218
No!

00:01:56.192 --> 00:01:57.772
I got him!

00:01:59.072 --> 00:02:01.612
I finally got him!
[cackles]

00:02:01.778 --> 00:02:04.728
[thudding]

00:02:06.843 --> 00:02:08.383
What was that?

00:02:37.396 --> 00:02:39.256
[gasps]

00:02:41.676 --> 00:02:43.185
[yelps]

00:02:48.553 --> 00:02:51.851
[panting]

00:02:54.763 --> 00:02:56.663
It's over, Eggman.

00:02:58.062 --> 00:03:00.682
[chuckles]
I like the new look.
It works for you.

00:03:01.602 --> 00:03:04.602
What do you say
we just let bygones be bygones?

00:03:04.883 --> 00:03:06.682
I did some things,
you did some things.

00:03:06.782 --> 00:03:08.402
There are good people
on both sides.

00:03:10.463 --> 00:03:13.102
Surely two intelligent beings

00:03:14.782 --> 00:03:16.763
can work these things out!

00:03:23.970 --> 00:03:25.710
[grunts]

00:03:28.942 --> 00:03:29.942
Come on, buddy.

00:03:30.048 --> 00:03:31.516
Get him, Sonic!
Come on.

00:03:31.623 --> 00:03:32.623
Yeah. Come on.

00:03:36.632 --> 00:03:38.365
[gasping]

00:03:49.743 --> 00:03:51.003
It's like that?

00:03:52.703 --> 00:03:54.363
Okay, we're not friends.

00:03:58.725 --> 00:04:01.188
Later, hater!

00:04:12.586 --> 00:04:14.556
Sonic!
Buddy! [laughs]

00:04:14.663 --> 00:04:16.623
Wait!
You cannot touch him!

00:04:17.263 --> 00:04:19.763
The hedgehog holds
the power of the Emerald.

00:04:20.463 --> 00:04:24.062
I am sorry.
He is no longer
the Sonic you once knew.

00:04:24.543 --> 00:04:25.543
What?

